  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。強い酸味と　軽い甘みが　ある。脂っこい食材と　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛이 강한 식재료. 강한 신맛과 가벼운 단맛이 난다. 느끼한 식재료와 궁합이 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味強勁的食材。此外還帶有些許甘甜，和油膩的食材相當搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très acide. Son acidité est adoucie par une touche sucrée qui en fait l’accompagnement idéal des ingrédients plus riches.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese sehr saure Zutat besitzt zudem eine leichte Süße, weshalb sie gut mit fettigen Zutaten harmoniert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una fruta de sabor muy ácido, pero con un ligero toque dulce. Complementa muy bien los ingredientes con alto contenido graso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto aspro, ma con un leggero tocco di dolcezza. Si abbina bene con gli ingredienti grassi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very tart ingredient that has a light touch of sweetness as well. It goes well with rich ingredients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。強い酸味と　軽い甘みが　ある。脂っこい食材と　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
